---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const hero = "/assets/About%20Us/about%20us.jpg";
const gallery = [
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8447.jpg",
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8454.jpg",
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8469.jpg",
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8482.jpg",
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8498.jpg",
  "/assets/2025_FUTUREMEDIA_CLIENT_FUNCTION/CLB8517.jpg",
  "/assets/NEDBANK_IMC_CONFERENCE_2025/DSC_5591_1.jpg",
  "/assets/NEDBANK_IMC_CONFERENCE_2025/DSC_5618_1.jpg",
  "/assets/conference/slide1.webp",
  "/assets/conference/slide2.webp",
  "/assets/ContactUs/CLB8469.jpg",
  "/assets/homepage/homepage.jpg",
];
---
<Layout title="About – FutureMedia" bodyClass="about-page" preload={hero}>
<section class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src={hero} alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
  <div class="about-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Future Media</p>
    <h1>People first.<br>Media that matters.</h1>
    <p>We are Namibia’s home of trusted broadcast and digital brands - built by people who care about communities, clients and the craft of connection.</p>
    <a class="pill" href="#story">Our story</a>
  </div>
</section>

<main class="about">
  <section class="about-story" id="story">
    <p class="eyebrow">Where it began</p>
    <h2>A rare inheritance.</h2>
    <div class="about-story-with-media">
      <div>
        <p>When Future Media was established in 2019, we inherited something rare - a portfolio of broadcast brands that Namibians had already spent decades trusting. Omulunga Radio, Radiowave, 99FM, Fresh FM, Nova 103.5, OneAfrica.tv, and Property News weren’t new ideas. They were household names, woven into the daily rhythms of Namibian life.</p>
        <p>Together, we already reached more than two million Namibians - over 70% of the country - across every major language, demographic, and region. The question wasn’t how to build an audience. We already had one. The question was what to do with that reach, and what responsibility it carried.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="about-shot">
        <img src={gallery[2]} alt="Future Media team" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </figure>
    </div>
    <ul class="about-stats">
      <li><b>2019</b><span>Established</span></li>
      <li><b>2M+</b><span>Namibians reached</span></li>
      <li><b>70%</b><span>Of the country</span></li>
      <li><b>20</b><span>Trusted brands</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="about-mosaic" aria-label="Life at Future Media">
    <div class="about-mosaic-grid">
      <figure class="tall"><img src={gallery[0]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      <figure><img src={gallery[1]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      <figure><img src={gallery[3]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      <figure class="wide"><img src={gallery[4]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      <figure><img src={gallery[6]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
      <figure class="tall"><img src={gallery[7]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-story about-story-split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The evolution</p>
      <h2>Deliberate growth.</h2>
      <p>What followed was not a dramatic reinvention. It was something more considered - a gradual expansion, led by a management team that understood Namibia from the inside. Our broadcasting roots stayed intact. Around them, new capabilities grew.</p>
      <p>Today we are Namibia’s largest independent media group - an ecosystem of 20 trusted brands across radio, television, digital, branding, property and retail media, with over 475 active client partnerships and more than 27 million audience engagements over any three-month period.</p>
      <p class="about-line">We grow businesses and support communities through meaningful connections. That has always been what this was about.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-side-stack">
      <figure class="about-shot">
        <img src={gallery[5]} alt="Future Media moments" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </figure>
      <ul class="about-stats about-stats-stack">
        <li><b>475+</b><span>Client partnerships</span></li>
        <li><b>27M</b><span>Engagements each quarter</span></li>
        <li><b>20</b><span>Brands in one home</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-band">
    <div class="about-band-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src={gallery[8]} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div class="about-band-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Across Namibia</p>
      <h2>On air. On screen. Online.</h2>
      <p>From morning drive to evening news, from property listings to in-store audio - we build the platforms brands need to be seen, heard and remembered.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-who">
    <div class="about-who-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
      <h2>What guides us every day.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="beliefs">
      <article class="belief navy">
        <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><g fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M32 7v6M32 51v6M7 32h6M51 32h6M14 14l4.2 4.2M45.8 45.8 50 50M50 14l-4.2 4.2M18.2 45.8 14 50"/><path d="M14 32c4.6-8.2 10.6-12.2 18-12.2S45.4 23.8 50 32c-4.6 8.2-10.6 12.2-18 12.2S18.6 40.2 14 32z"/></g><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="4" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>Future Media is the leading provider of marketing communications solutions in Namibia.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="belief wine">
        <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><g fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="27" cy="36" r="15"/><circle cx="27" cy="36" r="8"/><path d="M34 29 54 11M44 11h10v10"/></g><circle cx="27" cy="36" r="2.6" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>We connect businesses and communities by delivering effective, integrated marketing communications, across an ever-evolving ecosystem of trusted brands, platforms, and people.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="belief navy">
        <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M8 50 22 26l9 12 12-20 13 32H8z" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M43 18V8" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M43 8h11l-3.4 4.2L54 16.4H43z" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Our Purpose</h3><p>We grow businesses and support communities through meaningful connections.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="belief wine">
        <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M31 7.5c1.4-2.8 4-4.2 6.2-2.8 2.1 1.2 2.6 3.8 1.3 5.8C36.4 13.6 31 18 31 18s-5.4-4.4-7.5-7.5c-1.3-2-.8-4.6 1.3-5.8 2.2-1.4 4.8 0 6.2 2.8z" fill="#fff"/><path d="M18 36c.4-4.6 3.6-7.4 7-6.8 1.6.2 3 1.2 3.6 2.6M28.6 31.4c.2-5 3.4-8 6.8-7.2 2.8.6 4.4 3.2 4.4 6V40M40 32.4c.8-4.2 4-6.6 7-5.4 2.6 1 4 3.6 3.2 6.6L47.2 46c-1.4 5-6 8.6-11.2 8.6-6.4 0-12.6-3.2-14.4-8.2l-1.4-4.6c-.8-2.6.4-5.2 3-5.6 1.6-.2 3.2.6 4 2.2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <div><h3>Our Values</h3><p>Trust. Innovation. Excellence. Adaptability. Nawa.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Layout>
